Dear plot holders,

A few things as we close out the season.

The water goes off for the winter on Saturday, November 14. The gate stays open from 8 am to
4 pm every day through the winter.

One ask: from the 14th until spring, please put kitchen scraps in the green bin and not on
the open compost pile. The pile draws raccoons once the weather turns.

Thank you, all.

Imogen Vance
Volunteer coordinator, Willow Bend Community Garden
